rs/chrislusf/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrislusf/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrislusf/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrislusf/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-03-12T20:47:26Z","updated_at":"2026-03-12T20:47:26Z","body":"  When `allowEmptyFolder=false`, a Cassandra (or any store) timeout during\n  ListDirectoryEntries would return an empty result with no error. The filer would then\n  conclude the directory is empty and delete all children's metadata — catastrophic data\n  loss.\n\n  PR #7485 — Already merged into this codebase. It changes the ListEachEntryFunc callback\n  signature from bool → (bool, error) across all filer stores, and propagates errors\n  through every layer.","author_association":"COLLABORATOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/seaweedfs/seaweedfs/issues/comments/4049941479/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]]